          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#6",
          "text": "到这里我们结束了机械振动和电振荡的学习. 这两种不",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 11,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1016,
            1058
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#6",
          "text": "同本质的过程，它们的一般特征相同，描写它们的数学方程式",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 12,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1089,
            1133
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#6",
          "text": "也相同. 正如我们所看到的，这些相同点使学习振荡变得容",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 13,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1161,
            1199
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#6",
          "text": "易了.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 14,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1261,
            1298
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#7",
          "text": "问题",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 15,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1350,
            1392
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#8",
          "text": "1. 在纯电阻为 $R$ 的振荡回路中，共振时，电流强度的振",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 16,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1418,
            1465
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#8",
          "text": "幅能否超过纯电阻也为 $R$，而电压等于交流电压振幅的直流",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 17,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1492,
            1533
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#8",
          "text": "电路中的电流强度?",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 18,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1567,
            1608
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#9",
          "text": "2. 在三极管中，栅极的作用是什么?",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 19,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1636,
            1679
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#10",
          "text": "3. 在电子管振荡器里反馈是怎样实现的?",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 20,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1708,
            1755
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#11",
          "text": "4. 指出自激振荡系统的基本组成部分（以电子管振荡器",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 21,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1779,
            1820
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#11",
          "text": "为例）.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 22,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1896,
            1935
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#12",
          "text": "练习 2",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 23,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1983,
            2024
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#13",
          "text": "1. 把 $q=10^{-5}$ 库仑的电荷传给振荡回路的电容器以后，在回路里",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 24,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            2055,
            2079
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0086#14",
          "text": "• 76 •",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        }
