      "rows": [
        {
          "printedRow": 1,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            196,
            230
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#1",
          "text": "发生阻尼振荡. 当回路里振荡完全衰减时，在回路里有多少热量放出?",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 2,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            258,
            293
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#1",
          "text": "电容器的电容 $C=0.01$ 微法拉",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 3,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            317,
            353
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#2",
          "text": "2. 振荡回路由自感系数 $L=0.003$ 亨的线圈和半径 $r=1.2$ 厘米、",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 4,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            378,
            413
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#2",
          "text": "相互间距离 $d=0.3$ 毫米的两圆形板组成的平行板电容器组成. 求：回",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 5,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            438,
            471
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#2",
          "text": "路中自由振荡的周期. 如果电容器两板间的空隙用介电常数 $\\varepsilon=4$ 的电",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 6,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            497,
            531
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#2",
          "text": "介质充满，振荡周期将是多少?",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 7,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            559,
            592
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#3",
          "text": "3. 为了使振荡频率从 400 变至 500 赫兹，振荡回路线圈的自感系",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 8,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            617,
            655
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#3",
          "text": "数应该在什么样的范围内变化? 电容器的电容是 10 微法拉.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 9,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            685,
            719
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#4",
          "text": "4. 已知线圈旋转频率是 50 转/秒，线圈框的面积是 100 厘米$^2$，磁",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 10,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            742,
            782
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#4",
          "text": "感应强度是 0.2 特斯拉，求：在匀强磁场里旋转的导线框上的感生电动",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 11,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            804,
            836
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#4",
          "text": "势的振幅.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 12,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            871,
            910
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#5",
          "text": "5. 在截面积 $S=100$ 厘米$^2$ 的导线框里引起的感生电动势的振幅",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 13,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            929,
            971
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#5",
          "text": "$\\mathcal{E}_{м}=1.4$ 伏，导线框的匝数 $n=200$，导线框在匀强磁场里以恒定的角速",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 14,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            991,
            1032
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#5",
          "text": "度旋转，磁场的磁感应强度 $B=0.15$ 特斯拉. 在初始时刻，导线框的平",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 15,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1052,
            1093
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#5",
          "text": "面垂直于矢量 $\\vec{B}$. 求：在导线框开始运动 $t=0.1$ 秒后，导线框里的感",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 16,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1113,
            1147
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#5",
          "text": "生电动势 $\\mathcal{E}$.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 17,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1179,
            1220
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#6",
          "text": "6. 自感系数 $L=0.08$ 亨的线圈接在 $\\nu=100$ 赫兹的交流电源上，",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 18,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1239,
            1279
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#6",
          "text": "电压的有效值 $U=100$ 伏，求电路里电流的振幅 $I_{м}$.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 19,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1307,
            1349
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#7",
          "text": "7. 电流频率是 1000 赫兹. 求：由电容为 1 微法拉的电容器和自",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 20,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1366,
            1408
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#7",
          "text": "感系数为 0.05 亨的线圈串联组成的电路的总阻抗. 电阻可以忽略不",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 21,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1427,
            1459
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#7",
          "text": "计.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 22,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1496,
            1536
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#8",
          "text": "8. 如果发电机给予电路的功率是 8 千瓦，电路的电流振幅是 100",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 23,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1555,
            1597
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#8",
          "text": "安，在发电机接线柱上的电压振幅是 200 伏. 求：电路里的电压和电",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 24,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1616,
            1649
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#8",
          "text": "流间的相位差.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 25,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1683,
            1725
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#9",
          "text": "9. 一自感系数为 2 亨利，绕组的纯电阻为 100 欧姆的有铁芯的",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 26,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1742,
            1786
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#9",
          "text": "螺线管，先接在电压为 20 伏的直流电路上，然后又接在电压有效值为",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 27,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1803,
            1847
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#9",
          "text": "20 伏，频率为 400 赫兹的交流电路上. 求两种情况下通过螺线管的电",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 28,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1863,
            1895
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#9",
          "text": "流.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 29,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            1932,
            1971
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#10",
          "text": "10. 画出图 43 所示的交流电路共振时的矢量图.",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        },
        {
          "printedRow": 30,
          "coarseOriginalY": [
            2015,
            2040
          ],
          "sourceRef": "p0087#11",
          "text": "• 77 •",
          "basis": "manually-transcribed-actual-original-pixels"
        }
      ]
